s multiple test cases. The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 10^5$$$) — the length of the string $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains a string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$. It is guaranteed that all characters of $$$s$$$ are digits from $$$0$$$ to $$$9$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case print one integer — the number of diverse substrings of the given string $$$s$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\n1\n7\n2\n77\n4\n1010\n5\n01100\n6\n399996\n5\n23456\n18\n789987887987998798\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n2\n10\n12\n10\n15\n106\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, the diverse substring is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"7"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"tex